{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52576","headline":"忆嵩山陆浑旧宅 · 宋之问","name":"忆嵩山陆浑旧宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世德辞贵仕，天爵光道门。\n好仙宅二室，受药居陆浑。\n清白立家训，偃息爲国藩。\n乔树南勿翦，弊庐北尚存。\n自惟实蒙陋，何颜称子孙。\n少秉阳许意，遭逢明圣恩。\n挥翰云龙署，参光天马辕。\n一身事扃闼，十载隔凉暄。\n陈力试叨进，祗宠固幽源。\n况以沈疾久，睽辞金马垣。\n天子犹未识，讵敢栖丘樊。\n昼怀秘书谷，夕梦子平村。\n撷芳岁云晏，投绋意弥敦。\n皇私傥以报，无负青春言。\n（同前第三五二九页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}